      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was named after Steven Bitely, who built a sawmill there; a typo once spelled the post office as Biteley.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
